 Application AI behavior setup (trusted system instructions, injection/output policy, preprocessing/enrichment and tool chains) follows [backend_ai_setup.md](backend_ai_setup.md). The CLI manages supported environment settings; current behavior customization requires explicit code/composition work. Derived bundles include README.md, this runbook and the AI setup guide; existing project documents/code are preserved on reruns.
 
 Knowledge: configure KNOWLEDGE_ENGINE=disabled/postgres and KNOWLEDGE_MAX_DOCUMENTS=1..1024 (default64 lifetime IDs per private/shared scope). See backend_knowledge_spec.md for separate PDF/text folder preview/import, protected ID-token references, permissions, document replacement/deletion, bounds and deferred semantic activation. Setup stays offline and does not read/upload books or contact providers.
 
